      "translations": {
        "en": "and you bow on the seventh. And in the second, you say: ‘Allah is greater. I bear witness that there is no god but Allah, alone, without partner, and I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and His Messenger. O Allah, You are worthy of majesty and greatness.’ You complete all of it just as you said at the beginning of the takbir. This statement is to be in every takbir until you complete five takbirs. And the khutbah in the two Eids is after the prayer.”"
